  "body": "  A complete, -well-powered category with a small cogenerating family is cocomplete. Dually, a cocomplete, -co-well-powered category with a small generating family is complete.    For each small , the diagonal preserves small limits, computed pointwise. The special adjoint theorem gives a left adjoint to , hence all -shaped colimits by . The functor category is locally small because is small. The second assertion is dual.   "
