  "body": "  For presheaves , define For , its restriction sends to . This defines a presheaf and an exponential, with evaluation Consequently is cartesian closed.    The natural-transformation sets in the formula belong to by . Precomposition with has the stated contravariant direction and respects identities and composition. Thus is a presheaf with the required size.  Evaluation is natural. For , naturality of gives The right side is evaluation at of the restricted transformation and the restricted element .  Given , define by sending to the transformation whose component at is Naturality of and the presheaf rules prove naturality of this transformation in : restricting by gives on either side. Likewise, restricting along replaces by , exactly the arrow rule for . Hence is natural in .  Conversely, a transformation gives This is natural by evaluation. Starting with , transposing and evaluating returns it because . Starting with , naturality along gives so the transpose of the evaluated transformation returns at every component. These constructions are inverse, and evaluation gives precisely the defining exponential bijection.   "
