  "title": "Regular category.",
  "body": " Regular category  Regular category   A regular category is a finitely complete category in which every kernel pair has a coequalizer and regular epimorphisms are stable under pullback. Stability means that the pullback of any regular epimorphism along any arrow is again a regular epimorphism.   "
